{"seq":3,"slug":"incremental-builds","title":"增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/incremental-builds","wordCount":870,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"增量构建\">增量构建</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>增量构建</strong>的核心是&quot;只重新构建受变更影响的最小包集合&quot;。它由三个概念构成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对应能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变更检测</td>\n<td>找出本次改动了哪些文件/包</td>\n<td>Git diff、<code>[HEAD~1]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影响范围（affected）</td>\n<td>变更包 + 其所有下游依赖方</td>\n<td><code>...pkg</code>、<code>nx affected</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤（filter）</td>\n<td>用表达式圈定要执行的任务子集</td>\n<td><code>--filter=pkg</code> / <code>pkg...</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于区分两种方向：<code>pkg...</code> 是&quot;该包及其上游依赖&quot;（保证依赖链完整），<code>...pkg</code> 是&quot;所有依赖该包的包&quot;（验证下游是否受影响）。增量构建与缓存是互补的——增量缩小<strong>执行范围</strong>，缓存缩短<strong>单任务耗时</strong>；在 CI 中二者叠加可把构建范围削减 50–90%。TypeScript Project References 则把增量粒度提升到<strong>文件级</strong>，通过 <code>.tsbuildinfo</code> 记录编译状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量构建的核心思想\">增量构建的核心思想</h2><p><strong>增量构建</strong>（Incremental Build）的核心思想是：只重新构建受变更影响的最小包集合。在一个包含 50 个包的 Monorepo 中，如果只修改了 <code>@myorg/utils</code> 的一个函数，全量构建需要重新构建全部 50 个包，而增量构建只需要构建 <code>utils</code> 及其下游依赖——可能只有 5 个包。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 全量构建&#10;        ALL[构建全部 50 个包&lt;br/&gt;耗时 5 分钟]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 增量构建&#10;        CHANGED[检测变更&lt;br/&gt;utils 被修改]&#10;        AFFECTED[计算影响范围&lt;br/&gt;utils → ui → web, admin]&#10;        BUILD[只构建 5 个包&lt;br/&gt;耗时 30 秒]&#10;        CHANGED --&gt; AFFECTED --&gt; BUILD&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 全量构建\n        ALL[构建全部 50 个包&lt;br/&gt;耗时 5 分钟]\n    end\n    subgraph 增量构建\n        CHANGED[检测变更&lt;br/&gt;utils 被修改]\n        AFFECTED[计算影响范围&lt;br/&gt;utils → ui → web, admin]\n        BUILD[只构建 5 个包&lt;br/&gt;耗时 30 秒]\n        CHANGED --&gt; AFFECTED --&gt; BUILD\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"turborepo-filter-机制\">Turborepo --filter 机制</h2><p>Turborepo 的 <code>--filter</code> 参数是增量构建的主要手段，支持丰富的过滤语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 按包名过滤&#10;// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui&#10;&#10;// 按目录过滤&#10;// turbo run build --filter=./apps/*&#10;&#10;// 按依赖关系过滤：构建 ui 及其所有依赖&#10;// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui...&#10;&#10;// 按依赖关系过滤：构建所有依赖 ui 的包&#10;// turbo run build --filter=...@myorg/ui&#10;&#10;// 基于 Git diff 的变更检测&#10;// turbo run build --filter=...[HEAD~1]&#10;// turbo run build --filter=...[main...HEAD]&#10;// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui...[origin/main...HEAD]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按包名过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按目录过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=./apps/*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按依赖关系过滤：构建 ui 及其所有依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按依赖关系过滤：构建所有依赖 ui 的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=...@myorg/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于 Git diff 的变更检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=...[HEAD~1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=...[main...HEAD]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo run build --filter=@myorg/ui...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过滤语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--filter=pkg</code></td>\n<td>只运行指定包</td>\n<td>开发时只构建当前包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=pkg...</code></td>\n<td>指定包及其所有依赖</td>\n<td>确保依赖链完整构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=...pkg</code></td>\n<td>所有依赖指定包的包</td>\n<td>验证下游是否受影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=...[ref]</code></td>\n<td>自 ref 以来有变更的包</td>\n<td>CI 中只构建变更部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter=./apps/*</code></td>\n<td>匹配目录模式</td>\n<td>只构建应用层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"nx-affected-检测\">Nx affected 检测</h2><p>Nx 的 <code>affected</code> 命令通过分析 Git diff 和项目依赖图，自动确定受影响的项目集合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 只构建受影响的项目&#10;// npx nx affected -t build&#10;// npx nx affected -t test&#10;// npx nx affected -t lint&#10;&#10;// 基于特定 base 和 head&#10;// npx nx affected -t build --base=main --head=HEAD&#10;&#10;// 查看受影响的项目列表&#10;// npx nx show projects --affected&#10;// npx nx affected --graph  // 可视化依赖图\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只构建受影响的项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx affected -t build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx affected -t test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx affected -t lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于特定 base 和 head</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx affected -t build --base=main --head=HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查看受影响的项目列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx show projects --affected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx nx affected --graph  // 可视化依赖图</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Git as Git Diff&#10;    participant Nx as Nx affected&#10;    participant Graph as 依赖图&#10;    participant Runner as 任务执行器&#10;&#10;    Git-&gt;&gt;Nx: 变更文件列表&#10;    Nx-&gt;&gt;Graph: 查询包含变更文件的项目&#10;    Graph-&gt;&gt;Nx: 直接变更项目&#10;    Nx-&gt;&gt;Graph: 查询下游依赖项目&#10;    Graph-&gt;&gt;Nx: 间接受影响项目&#10;    Nx-&gt;&gt;Runner: 执行受影响项目的任务\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Git as Git Diff\n    participant Nx as Nx affected\n    participant Graph as 依赖图\n    participant Runner as 任务执行器\n\n    Git-&gt;&gt;Nx: 变更文件列表\n    Nx-&gt;&gt;Graph: 查询包含变更文件的项目\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;Nx: 直接变更项目\n    Nx-&gt;&gt;Graph: 查询下游依赖项目\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;Nx: 间接受影响项目\n    Nx-&gt;&gt;Runner: 执行受影响项目的任务</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"typescript-project-references\">TypeScript Project References</h2><p><strong>TypeScript Project References</strong> 是 TypeScript 原生的增量编译机制。它允许将一个大型 TypeScript 项目拆分为多个子项目，每个子项目独立编译并生成 <code>.tsbuildinfo</code> 文件记录编译状态，实现真正的增量类型检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;composite&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;outDir&quot;: &quot;./dist&quot;,&#10;    &quot;rootDir&quot;: &quot;./src&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;src&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"composite\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rootDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;composite&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;outDir&quot;: &quot;./dist&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;references&quot;: [{ &quot;path&quot;: &quot;../types&quot; }, { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;../utils&quot; }],&#10;  &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;src&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"composite\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"references\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>根目录的 <code>tsconfig.json</code> 使用 <code>references</code> 串联所有子项目：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [],&#10;  &quot;references&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./packages/types&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./packages/utils&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./packages/ui&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./apps/web&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;path&quot;: &quot;./apps/admin&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"references\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./packages/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./packages/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./packages/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./apps/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./apps/admin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 使用 tsc --build 进行增量构建&#10;// tsc --build                    # 增量构建所有项目&#10;// tsc --build --verbose          # 显示详细构建信息&#10;// tsc --build --clean            # 清除构建产物&#10;// tsc --build --force            # 强制全量重建&#10;&#10;// .tsbuildinfo 文件记录了上次编译的文件哈希&#10;// 只有变更的文件会被重新编译\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 tsc --build 进行增量构建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tsc --build                    # 增量构建所有项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tsc --build --verbose          # 显示详细构建信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tsc --build --clean            # 清除构建产物</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tsc --build --force            # 强制全量重建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .tsbuildinfo 文件记录了上次编译的文件哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只有变更的文件会被重新编译</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>composite: true</code> 是 Project References 的必需配置。它强制要求 <code>declaration: true</code> 和所有文件必须被 <code>include</code> 或 <code>files</code> 覆盖，确保项目边界清晰。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"增量构建在-ci-中的应用\">增量构建在 CI 中的应用</h2><p>CI 环境是增量构建价值最大化的场景。通过对比 PR 分支与主分支的差异，精确确定需要构建和测试的包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml&#10;name: CI&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Build affected packages&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]&#10;&#10;      - name: Test affected packages&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run test --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]&#10;&#10;      - name: Lint affected packages&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run lint --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build affected packages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Test affected packages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run test --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Lint affected packages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm turbo run lint --filter=...[origin/main...HEAD]</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>fetch-depth: 0</code> 是必需的，否则 Git 无法计算与主分支的差异。如果仓库历史很长，可以使用 <code>fetch-depth: 2</code> 配合 <code>HEAD~1</code> 作为基准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"增量策略对比\">增量策略对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>精确度</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--filter</code> 手动指定</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>开发时构建特定包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git diff + filter</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CI 中的 PR 构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nx affected</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（自动）</td>\n<td>Nx 项目的标准方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TS Project References</td>\n<td>文件级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>类型检查增量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量 + 缓存</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>缓存命中率高时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((增量构建))&#10;    Turborepo filter&#10;      包名过滤&#10;      目录过滤&#10;      Git diff 过滤&#10;    Nx affected&#10;      自动检测&#10;      依赖图分析&#10;      可视化&#10;    TS Project References&#10;      composite 模式&#10;      tsbuildinfo&#10;      文件级增量&#10;    CI 应用&#10;      fetch-depth: 0&#10;      origin/main 基准&#10;      affected-only\">mindmap\n  root((增量构建))\n    Turborepo filter\n      包名过滤\n      目录过滤\n      Git diff 过滤\n    Nx affected\n      自动检测\n      依赖图分析\n      可视化\n    TS Project References\n      composite 模式\n      tsbuildinfo\n      文件级增量\n    CI 应用\n      fetch-depth: 0\n      origin/main 基准\n      affected-only</pre><ul>\n<li>增量构建的核心是只重新构建受变更影响的最小包集合，避免全量构建的浪费</li>\n<li>Turborepo 的 <code>--filter</code> 支持按包名、目录和 Git diff 多种过滤维度</li>\n<li>Nx 的 <code>affected</code> 命令自动分析 Git diff 和依赖图，开箱即用</li>\n<li>TypeScript Project References 实现文件级的增量类型检查，适合大型 TypeScript 项目</li>\n<li>CI 中应始终使用增量构建策略，配合 <code>fetch-depth: 0</code> 确保能正确计算变更范围</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"增量构建","id":"增量构建"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"增量构建的核心思想","id":"增量构建的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"Turborepo --filter 机制","id":"turborepo-filter-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Nx affected 检测","id":"nx-affected-检测"},{"level":2,"text":"TypeScript Project References","id":"typescript-project-references"},{"level":2,"text":"增量构建在 CI 中的应用","id":"增量构建在-ci-中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"增量策略对比","id":"增量策略对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/caching-strategies"},"next":{"title":"并行执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/parallel-execution"}}